                                internet ✗

  Tailscale lets you open each App with its own private HTTPS name from your phone, laptop or TV,
  wherever you are. Your Home network Addresses keep working.

  What is Tailscale?
  A service that joins your own devices into one private network, wherever they are. Only devices
  you sign in can see your Apps.

  On your phone or TV
  Install Tailscale on your phone, laptop or TV and sign in to the same account. Apple TV and
  Android TV have apps; other TVs may need the Home network Address.

  Turn on HTTPS
  Open https://login.tailscale.com/admin/dns, check MagicDNS is on and enable HTTPS. App names
  will appear in a public certificate log. This publishes the names, not access to your Apps.

  Give self-host a private key

